{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o048a","title":"曹叡游后园不许延毛后","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o048a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"曹叡游后园不许延毛后","evidence":["houfei-e-o048a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"游宴","evidence":["houfei-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0054","role":"请延","evidence":["houfei-e-o048a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"后园","evidence":["houfei-q-o048"]},"time":{"year":237,"label":"景初元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y237","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o026","basis":"景初元年"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o048a-q","houfei-q-o026","mingdi-q-o052","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o048a-q","source_order":[5,218,"O048a"],"order":1458}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0054","name":"郭皇后（曹叡后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o048a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-fd992a8af87f0d1fe23b","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年，帝游后园，召才人以上，曲宴极乐〖11〗。元后曰：“宜延皇后〖12〗。”帝弗许。乃禁左右，使不得宣〖13〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":76},{"id":"houfei-q-o026","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-365be41815d34bbf6899","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年夏，有司议定七庙。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"houfei-q-o048","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-fd992a8af87f0d1fe23b","layer":"original","quote":"帝之幸郭元后也〖10〗，后爱宠日弛。景初元年，帝游后园，召才人以上，曲宴极乐〖11〗。元后曰：“宜延皇后〖12〗。”帝弗许。乃禁左右，使不得宣〖13〗。后知之。明日，帝见后，后曰：“昨日游宴北园，乐乎？”帝以左右泄之，所杀十余人。赐后死，然犹加谥，葬愍陵；迁曾散骑常侍，后徙为羽林、虎贲中郎将、原武典农〖14〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
